          <formatted-text>
            <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='16'>1.) Focus marking efforts on high-performing regions.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='16'>2.) Increase investment in profitable product categories.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
