            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='16'>4.) Develop strategies to grow lower-performing customer segments.</run>
            <run>Æ&#10;</run>
            <run bold='true' fontname='Tableau Medium' fontsize='16'>5.) Promote top-selling products through targeted campaigns.</run>
